WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
Luke dashes after the target-combo knockdown.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.150
Ken reaches for a throw as Luke backs away.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.750
Standing heavy punch catches the missed throw as Punish Counter.

4
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.750
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ken.

5
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.750
Heavy Rising Uppercut follows the launcher.

6
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.950
Luke lands after the heavy Uppercut as Ken recovers.
